{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"questions\":[{\"id\":\"f8e9dcd5-68d3-47e6-af6e-c137093b9023\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"A prisoner seeks immediate release only because a remission request is pending, while custody rests on a valid sentence of a competent court. Which answer is most accurate?\",\"hi\":\"एक कैदी केवल इसलिए तत्काल मुक्ति चाहता है कि उसकी परिहार-अर्जी लंबित है, जबकि अभिरक्षा सक्षम न्यायालय के वैध दंडादेश पर आधारित है। सबसे सटीक उत्तर कौन-सा है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Habeas corpus automatically grants remission\",\"hi\":\"बंदी प्रत्यक्षीकरण स्वतः परिहार देता है\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Habeas corpus is not the ordinary means to replace lawful custody merely on that basis\",\"hi\":\"केवल उस आधार पर वैध अभिरक्षा को प्रतिस्थापित करने का बंदी प्रत्यक्षीकरण सामान्य साधन नहीं है\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Quo warranto grants release\",\"hi\":\"अधिकार-पृच्छा मुक्ति देती है\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Prohibition annuls the conviction automatically\",\"hi\":\"प्रतिषेध दोषसिद्धि स्वतः समाप्त करती है\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2019/18046/18046_2019_11_1501_19778_Judgement_23-Jan-2020.pdf#page=10 — Judgment dated 23 January 2020, paragraphs 14-17, PDF page 10: lawful detention limitation and core inquiry; Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2019/18046/18046_2019_11_1501_19778_Judgement_23-Jan-2020.pdf#page=16 — Judgment dated 23 January 2020, paragraphs 22-25, PDF page 16: procedural object and competent-court custody\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Home Secretary (Prison) v. H. Nilofer Nisha\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2019/18046/18046_2019_11_1501_19778_Judgement_23-Jan-2020.pdf#page=10\",\"citation\":\"Judgment dated 23 January 2020, paragraphs 14-17, PDF page 10: lawful detention limitation and core inquiry\"},{\"title\":\"The Home Secretary (Prison) v. H. Nilofer Nisha\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2019/18046/18046_2019_11_1501_19778_Judgement_23-Jan-2020.pdf#page=16\",\"citation\":\"Judgment dated 23 January 2020, paragraphs 22-25, PDF page 16: procedural object and competent-court custody\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"H. Nilofer Nisha judgment, paragraphs 14-17, official PDF page 10; H. Nilofer Nisha judgment, paragraphs 22-25, official PDF page 16\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"f4278599-b8b0-40ec-905e-ce7c8197170e\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Why did Joseph Shine find Section 497 inconsistent with substantive equality?\",\"hi\":\"जोसेफ शाइन ने धारा 497 को तात्त्विक समानता से असंगत क्यों पाया?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"It applied only to taxation\",\"hi\":\"यह केवल कराधान पर लागू थी\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"It perpetuated women’s subordinate status and gender stereotypes within marriage\",\"hi\":\"इसने विवाह में महिलाओं की अधीनस्थ स्थिति और लैंगिक रूढ़ियों को बनाए रखा\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"It required equal punishment for all spouses\",\"hi\":\"इसने सभी जीवनसाथियों के लिए समान दंड चाहा\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"It protected sexual autonomy\",\"hi\":\"इसने यौन स्वायत्तता की रक्षा की\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2017/32550/32550_2017_Judgement_27-Sep-2018.pdf#page=180 — Constitution Bench judgment, conclusions 1-4, PDF page 180: Section 497, equality, stereotypes, dignity, liberty, privacy and autonomy\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Joseph Shine v. Union of India\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2017/32550/32550_2017_Judgement_27-Sep-2018.pdf#page=180\",\"citation\":\"Constitution Bench judgment, conclusions 1-4, PDF page 180: Section 497, equality, stereotypes, dignity, liberty, privacy and autonomy\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Joseph Shine judgment, conclusions 1-4, official PDF page 180\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"f0e1aca8-f627-497f-9a67-02dd65526352\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"What kind of proceedings does Article 32(1) contemplate for moving the Supreme Court?\",\"hi\":\"सर्वोच्च न्यायालय जाने के लिए अनुच्छेद 32(1) किस प्रकार की कार्यवाही का विचार करता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Only a criminal appeal\",\"hi\":\"केवल दांडिक अपील\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Only a presidential reference\",\"hi\":\"केवल राष्ट्रपति का निर्देश\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Only a civil suit\",\"hi\":\"केवल दीवानी वाद\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Appropriate proceedings\",\"hi\":\"समुचित कार्यवाही\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India — https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=50 — Part III, Article 32(1)-(4), PDF page 50 (document page 19)\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=50\",\"citation\":\"Part III, Article 32(1)-(4), PDF page 50 (document page 19)\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Constitution of India, Article 32(1)-(4), official PDF page 50\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"RAILWAY\",\"STATE_ONEDAY\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"f01469b7-333f-4b76-bf25-e6ba5605b4fe\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"What precondition must exist before the President can make an order under Article 359(1)?\",\"hi\":\"अनुच्छेद 359(1) के अधीन राष्ट्रपति के आदेश से पहले कौन-सी पूर्वशर्त विद्यमान होनी चाहिए?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"A financial bill must fail\",\"hi\":\"वित्त विधेयक विफल होना चाहिए\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"A Proclamation of Emergency must be in operation\",\"hi\":\"आपातकाल की उद्घोषणा प्रवर्तन में होनी चाहिए\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Every High Court must consent\",\"hi\":\"प्रत्येक उच्च न्यायालय की सहमति होनी चाहिए\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"A State election must be pending\",\"hi\":\"राज्य निर्वाचन लंबित होना चाहिए\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India — https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=247 — Part XVIII, Article 359(1)-(1A) and amendment footnote, PDF page 247 (document page 216)\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"The Constitution of India (official Hindi-English diglot edition, as on 1 May 2024)\",\"institution\":\"Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice, Government of India\",\"url\":\"https://www.legislative.gov.in/static/uploads/2025/07/ca7ce5c746fa7480804bbdeb6cb704f0.pdf#page=247\",\"citation\":\"Part XVIII, Article 359(1)-(1A) and amendment footnote, PDF page 247 (document page 216)\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Constitution of India, Article 359(1)-(1A), official PDF page 247\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"edc7ac17-1240-43d2-a90c-9953a4438744\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"Can a constitutional court ordinarily issue mandamus directing a legislature to enact a law on a specified subject in a specified manner?\",\"hi\":\"क्या संवैधानिक न्यायालय सामान्यतः विधान-मंडल को किसी निर्दिष्ट विषय पर निर्दिष्ट ढंग से विधि बनाने का परमादेश दे सकता है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Yes, whenever any citizen prefers a law\",\"hi\":\"हाँ, जब भी कोई नागरिक किसी विधि को पसंद करे\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"Yes, without identifying any right\",\"hi\":\"हाँ, किसी अधिकार की पहचान के बिना\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"No\",\"hi\":\"नहीं\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Only a municipality can do so\",\"hi\":\"केवल नगर निकाय ऐसा कर सकता है\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2021/31894/31894_2021_11_1501_46028_Judgement_11-Aug-2023.pdf#page=10 — 2023 INSC 701, paragraph 12, PDF page 10: no mandamus to legislate in a particular manner; Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2021/31894/31894_2021_11_1501_46028_Judgement_11-Aug-2023.pdf#page=8 — 2023 INSC 701, paragraph 9, PDF page 8: existing right and corresponding State obligation\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Union of India v. K. Pushpavanam\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2021/31894/31894_2021_11_1501_46028_Judgement_11-Aug-2023.pdf#page=10\",\"citation\":\"2023 INSC 701, paragraph 12, PDF page 10: no mandamus to legislate in a particular manner\"},{\"title\":\"Union of India v. K. Pushpavanam\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2021/31894/31894_2021_11_1501_46028_Judgement_11-Aug-2023.pdf#page=8\",\"citation\":\"2023 INSC 701, paragraph 9, PDF page 8: existing right and corresponding State obligation\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"K. Pushpavanam judgment, paragraph 12, official PDF page 10; K. Pushpavanam judgment, paragraph 9, official PDF page 8\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\",\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"e8f026ee-c944-4c07-a4d5-9db631947327\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"A criminal law punishes “annoying” online messages but gives neither citizens nor police a workable standard. Which case is the closest authority?\",\"hi\":\"कोई दंड-विधि “कष्टप्रद” ऑनलाइन संदेशों को दंडित करती है, किंतु नागरिकों या पुलिस को कोई कार्यसाध्य मानक नहीं देती। कौन-सा मामला सबसे निकट प्राधिकार है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Joseph Shine\",\"hi\":\"जोसेफ शाइन\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"NALSA\",\"hi\":\"NALSA\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Shreya Singhal\",\"hi\":\"श्रेया सिंघल\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Vishaka\",\"hi\":\"विशाखा\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2020/583/583_2020_33_1501_25559_Judgement_19-Jan-2021.pdf#page=62 — 2021 judgment, paragraph 51, PDF page 62: Shreya Singhal overturned Section 66A for vagueness; Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2009/16113/16113_2009_1_1501_56604_Judgement_17-Oct-2024.pdf#page=224 — 2024 judgment, paragraphs 255-256 quoting Shreya Singhal, PDF page 224: no manageable standard under Section 66A\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"Manish Kumar v. Union of India\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2020/583/583_2020_33_1501_25559_Judgement_19-Jan-2021.pdf#page=62\",\"citation\":\"2021 judgment, paragraph 51, PDF page 62: Shreya Singhal overturned Section 66A for vagueness\"},{\"title\":\"In Re: Section 6A of the Citizenship Act, 1955\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2009/16113/16113_2009_1_1501_56604_Judgement_17-Oct-2024.pdf#page=224\",\"citation\":\"2024 judgment, paragraphs 255-256 quoting Shreya Singhal, PDF page 224: no manageable standard under Section 66A\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"Manish Kumar judgment, paragraph 51 restating Shreya Singhal, official PDF page 62; In Re: Section 6A judgment, paragraphs 255-256 quoting Shreya Singhal, official PDF page 224\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"e73e5b1e-aa8f-4b1d-8b4d-4a68dad6ba81\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"A formally private organisation performs a legally imposed public function and fails to discharge a positive obligation owed to affected persons. Which conclusion is most accurate under Article 226?\",\"hi\":\"औपचारिक रूप से निजी संगठन विधि द्वारा लगाया गया लोक-कार्य करता है और प्रभावित व्यक्तियों के प्रति सकारात्मक दायित्व निभाने में विफल रहता है। अनुच्छेद 226 के अधीन सबसे सटीक निष्कर्ष क्या है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Mandamus may be considered because the nature of the public duty, not formal label alone, is material\",\"hi\":\"परमादेश पर विचार हो सकता है क्योंकि केवल औपचारिक नाम नहीं, लोक-कर्तव्य की प्रकृति महत्त्वपूर्ण है\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"No writ can ever reach any private body\",\"hi\":\"कोई रिट कभी किसी निजी निकाय तक नहीं पहुँच सकती\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Quo warranto must automatically remove its employees\",\"hi\":\"अधिकार-पृच्छा उसके कर्मचारियों को स्वतः हटा देगी\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Certiorari becomes a contractual appeal\",\"hi\":\"उत्प्रेषण संविदात्मक अपील बन जाएगी\"}},\"difficulty\":\"advanced\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2022/40857/40857_2022_3_1505_53366_Judgement_16-May-2024.pdf#page=25 — 2024 INSC 425, paragraphs 34-35, PDF page 25: Article 226 and public-duty test; Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2022/40857/40857_2022_3_1505_53366_Judgement_16-May-2024.pdf#page=26 — 2024 INSC 425, paragraph 35, PDF page 26: positive public obligation and nature-of-duty test\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"R.S. Madireddy v. Union of India\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2022/40857/40857_2022_3_1505_53366_Judgement_16-May-2024.pdf#page=25\",\"citation\":\"2024 INSC 425, paragraphs 34-35, PDF page 25: Article 226 and public-duty test\"},{\"title\":\"R.S. Madireddy v. Union of India\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2022/40857/40857_2022_3_1505_53366_Judgement_16-May-2024.pdf#page=26\",\"citation\":\"2024 INSC 425, paragraph 35, PDF page 26: positive public obligation and nature-of-duty test\"}],\"secondary_sources\":[],\"evidence_locator\":\"R.S. Madireddy judgment, paragraphs 34-35, official PDF page 25; R.S. Madireddy judgment, paragraph 35, official PDF page 26\"},\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"STATE_PCS\",\"UPSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0},{\"id\":\"e66da2a9-09db-4f24-8f2c-a6877b7bca4a\",\"question_text\":{\"en\":\"When is certiorari ordinarily available in the prohibition-certiorari timing distinction?\",\"hi\":\"प्रतिषेध–उत्प्रेषण के समयगत भेद में उत्प्रेषण सामान्यतः कब उपलब्ध होती है?\"},\"options\":{\"A\":{\"en\":\"Before any proceeding begins in every case\",\"hi\":\"प्रत्येक मामले में कार्यवाही आरंभ होने से पहले\"},\"B\":{\"en\":\"After an amenable body has rendered a decision and a reviewable jurisdictional error is established\",\"hi\":\"आच्छादित निकाय द्वारा निर्णय दिए जाने और पुनर्विलोकनीय अधिकारिता-दोष सिद्ध होने के बाद\"},\"C\":{\"en\":\"Only to appoint a public officer\",\"hi\":\"केवल लोक अधिकारी नियुक्त करने के लिए\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Only to compel Parliament to legislate\",\"hi\":\"केवल संसद को विधि बनाने के लिए बाध्य करने हेतु\"}},\"difficulty\":\"intermediate\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified v2026-07-18: Supreme Court of India — https://api.sci.gov.in/supremecourt/2008/16520/16520_2008_11_1502_16692_Judgement_12-Sep-2019.pdf#page=27 — Judgment dated 12 September 2019, paragraph 29, PDF page 27: prohibition/certiorari timing and supervisory scope\",\"source_metadata\":{\"primary_sources\":[{\"title\":\"General Manager, Electrical Rengali Hydro Electric Project v. Giridhari Sahu\",\"institution\":\"Supreme Court of India\",\"url\":\"ht